    <string name="xdrip_setup_title">📡 xDrip+ / AAPS Setup</string>
    <string name="xdrip_setup_msg">MMT7821-Client broadcasts glucose readings via Android Intent:\ncom.eveningoutpost.dexdrip.BgEstimate\n\nTo receive readings in xDrip+:\n1. Open xDrip+ → Settings → Hardware Data Source.\n2. Select \"640G / EverSense\" or \"Libre (patched App)\" (depending on xDrip+ version).\n3. In xDrip+ → Inter-app settings, enable \"Accept Broadcasts\" (if available) and \"Broadcast Locally\" to forward to AAPS.\n\nTo receive in AndroidAPS (AAPS):\n• Config Builder → BG Source → select \"xDrip+\".\n\nTip: Disable battery optimization for both apps so background broadcasts are not delayed.</string>
